    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ballymacahara is an exceptional 3 bed detached residence on a stunning, c 0.55 acre (0.22Ha) site with incredible views over the rolling Wicklow countryside. This wonderful home is nestled into the hillside in the beautiful and highly sought after location of Ballymacahara, on the outskirts of Ashford Village. Surrounded by some of the finest homes in the area, this property offers exceptional privacy and breathtaking panoramic views towards historic Glanmore, the majestic Devil's Glen, and beautiful Nun's Cross Church. Contact Stephen Clarke today to arrange a viewing. \n\nThis striking bungalow comprises a bright and welcoming entrance hall, three well appointed bedrooms (one with a generous ensuite), a beautiful family bathroom, and a generous open-plan kitchen/living/dining room with a vaulted ceiling, spectacular views. Double doors open out from the living area onto the huge patio/rooftop terrace, which takes full advantage of the afternoon and evening sun and is ideal for entertaining and perfectly positioned to capture the most spectacular views across the surrounding countryside. The property has been completely renovated to a very high standard in recent years with solid timber internal doors and high quality double glazed windows throughout. The property has been replumbed and rewired and thermally wrapped.\n\nA further standout feature is the large detached garage, cleverly set into the sloped site. A wrap around tarmac driveway sweeps down from the entrance gates to a parking area with ample parking for several cars. The garage itself is equipped with electric roller doors at both ends for excellent accessibility and functionality. Whilst the 0.55-acre site is mature, elevated and offers a wonderful setting, it also provides enormous potential for further landscaping, gardening, or an extension (subject to planning permission) to create an outstanding contemporary family residence.\n\nBallymacahara is situated on the outskirts of Ashford Village surrounded by some of the most beautiful countryside in the garden county and a stones throw from the village centre and all local amenities. This area of Wicklow offers woodland walks, golden sandy beaches and the majestic Wicklow Mountains on your doorstep, all within 30 minutes of South Dublin and the M50. The renowned and re imagined Avoca Cafe and shops at world famous Mount Usher are minutes from your door. There are excellent schools, shops, pubs and restaurants in the immediate vicinity. Ashford has become a haven for the commuter and one of the most sought after residential areas of Co. Wicklow. \nFor the golfer, there are a myriad of choices within easy reach including the excellent Druids Glen, Blainroe, Wicklow and the world class European club. For the commuter, the M11 motorway to Dublin is five minutes away. The beautiful harbour towns of Wicklow Town and Greystones are equally accessible, along with all their numerous amenities. Dart services are available from Greystones as well as an excellent bus service from Ashford Village & trains to the city from Wicklow Town.\n\nUnique properties like Ballymacahara come along once in a lifetime and this a fantastic opportunity to acquire a wonderful home with the most beautiful views, in one of the most sought after locations in County Wicklow. Call us today to arrange a viewing."
      },
